flowchart TD
  I[Report dispute suspicious payment or unsafe listing] --> T{Immediate danger or clearly prohibited}
  T -->|Yes| R[Restrict post or account and preserve case evidence]
  T -->|No| Q[Classify severity and assign case owner]
  R --> E[Administrator evidence review]
  Q --> E
  E --> D{Decision}
  D -->|No violation| C[Close with documented reason]
  D -->|Fixable issue| F[Request correction or additional verification]
  D -->|Policy violation| S[Suspend remove or escalate]
  F --> N[Notify affected members]
  S --> N
  C --> N
  N --> A[Write immutable audit record]
